            "title": "What is the difference between Force Architecte and Thérapiste?",
            "content": "<p>Force Architecte targets erosion levels 1–2 — mild to moderate damage from heat styling or occasional chemical service. Thérapiste targets levels 3–4 — severely over-processed hair from repeated bleaching or multiple services. Both reconstruct, but Thérapiste is the higher-potency intervention. If Force Architecte has not resolved breakage after four to six weeks, escalate to the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-resistance-therapiste\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Resistance Therapiste at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Thérapiste sub-line</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Does Kérastase Extentioniste make hair grow?",
            "content": "<p>No — Extentioniste is about length <em>retention</em>, not growth stimulation. It reinforces the lengths of damaged hair and targets split ends, so the hair you grow stays instead of snapping at the mid-lengths and tips. The hero step is the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-resistance-serum-extentioniste-50ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Resistance Extentioniste Sérum 50ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Extentioniste Sérum</a>, a leave-on applied along the lengths; the full lineup is in the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-resistance-extentioniste\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Resistance Extentioniste at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Extentioniste collection</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can I use Kérastase Résistance every day?",
            "content": "<p>Yes for the shampoos, conditioners, and leave-on serums — they are formulated for frequent use, daily washing included, which is common here. The mask is the exception: use it weekly as a treatment rather than every wash. The Ciment Thermique primer is used at each blow-dry.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Which Kérastase Résistance is for rebonded hair in the Philippines?",
            "content": "<p>In the first few months after rebonding, while the hair is still relatively intact, <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-resistance-force-architecte\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Resistance Force Architecte at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Force Architecte</a> is the fit. In the fragile weeks immediately after the service, or for hair rebonded several times, <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-resistance-therapiste\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Resistance Therapiste at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Thérapiste</a> is more appropriate. For long hair with damage concentrated at the ends from earlier rebonds, layer on the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/products/kerastase-resistance-serum-extentioniste-50ml\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Resistance Extentioniste Sérum 50ml at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Extentioniste Sérum</a>.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q5": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I buy authentic Kérastase Résistance in the Philippines?",
            "content": "<p>HairMNL is an authorized Kérastase retailer, sourcing directly and guaranteeing authenticity — something long-term buyers value. As verified customer Charisse M wrote in July 2025, the products are <em>\"100% authentic, and they truly deliver on their promises.\"</em> Shop the full range at the <a href=\"https://www.hairmnl.com/collections/kerastase-resistance\" title=\"Shop Kérastase Resistance at HairMNL\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">Kérastase Résistance collection</a>.</p>"
